<title>UK: Single wet Brent kept by Suko - traders.</title>
<headline>Single wet Brent kept by Suko - traders.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The single Brent cargo turning wet on Thursday was kept by Suko ahead of the five o'clock deadline, traders said.</p>
<p>The cargo is due to load in the June 6-8 period.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom, +44 151 542 8145</p>
